<h2>Nextflow Global Configuration</h2>

<p>To configure your Nextflow settings, you can access the configuration file and fine-tune it according to your specific needs. Additionally, Nextflow offers robust support for environment variables, allowing you to easily integrate Cloudgene variables into your configuration. This <code>nextflow.config</code> file applies to <b>all</b> applications.</p>

<hr class="mb-4"/>

<form>

  <div class="mb-3">
    <p class="mb-0">Custom Configuration:</p>
    <p class="mb-0"><small class="text-muted">All global parameters can be set here.</small></p>
  </div>

  <div style=" display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: row;">

    <div style="width: 75%; align-self: stretch;">
      <textarea
        class="form-control mb-4"
        id="config"
        name="config"
        style="height: 550px; font-size: 14px; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace;"
      >{{nextflowConfig.attr('config')}}</textarea>

      <div class="mb-3">
        <p class="mb-0">Custom Environment:</p>
        <p class="mb-0"><small class="text-muted">All global environment variables can be set here.</small></p>
      </div>

      <textarea
        class="form-control mb-4"
        id="env"
        name="env"
        style="height: 550px; font-size: 14px; font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier New, monospace;"
      >{{nextflowConfig.attr('env')}}</textarea>

    </div>

    <div style="flex:1">
      <ul>
        {{#nextflowConfig.variables}}
          <li class="mb-2">
            <div>
              <b><code>$&#123;{{name}}&#125;</code></b>
            </div>
            <div>
              <small>Value: {{value}}</small>
            </div>
          </li>
        {{/nextflowConfig.variables}}
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>

  <hr/>

  <div class="mb-3">
    <button id="save" class="btn btn-primary" data-loading-text="please wait...">
      <i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save changes
    </button>
  </div>

</form>
